# Backward-compatible redirects for product/application paths that were
# served from the apex (guideherd.ai) before the repository split.
# Every already-issued link — /manage/<token>, /intake/<token>, staff
# console paths — keeps working by forwarding, path- and query-preserving,
# to the product origin app.guideherd.ai.
#
# 302 (temporary) on purpose: a permanent 301 would be cached by browsers
# and intermediaries and make a rollback to the apex hazardous. Marketing
# routes, /status/, and unknown paths are deliberately NOT listed, so they
# are served or 404 as normal.

/receptionist/*   https://app.guideherd.ai/receptionist/:splat   302
/operations/*     https://app.guideherd.ai/operations/:splat     302
/admin/*          https://app.guideherd.ai/admin/:splat          302
/manage/*         https://app.guideherd.ai/manage/:splat         302
/intake/*         https://app.guideherd.ai/intake/:splat         302
/intake-review/*  https://app.guideherd.ai/intake-review/:splat  302
/documents/*      https://app.guideherd.ai/documents/:splat      302
/demo/*           https://app.guideherd.ai/demo/:splat           302
